ard sell.</li></ul><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>Perfect for creators in:</strong><br>Oral care and \"tooth-tok,\" Invisalign and aligner journeys, self-care and hygiene, beauty, wellness, lifestyle, and parents of kids in braces or retainers.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>What you get:</strong></p><ul class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\"><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">15% commission on every sale you drive</li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Your own discount code + tracking link — your audience saves, you earn, and code-based tracking means every sale counts</li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">30-day cookie window</li></ul><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>Ready to clean up?</strong> Join the idyll affiliate program and start earning on a product people are happy to talk about.</p></div></div>",
